      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.28 (vs ₹0.89 loss in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.28 (up from ₹0.89 loss in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹162.7m (up 1.3% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹1.48m (up ₹6.16m from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 0.9% (up from net loss in 3Q 2025). The move to profitability was primarily driven by lower expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 60% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 1% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings.",
